{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Justice</strong> is a cosmic bullet-hell roguelike inspired by classic Shoot\u2019em Ups and expanded with a unique upgrade system powered by Core Enhancers. Their synergies let you shred space pirates and bosses into stardust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge surprising super-combos with unique Core Enhancers to unlock wild effects and interactions. Earn space credits to grab epic and legendary devices, and discover secret synergies as you progress. Any advantage might be the key to liberating star systems and defeating the ultimate boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/96a6470e52fa354571e957d6de94d0d0.poster.avif?t=1768973492\" aria-label=\"Unlock devastating Enhancer Cores in an epic space roguelike!\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/96a6470e52fa354571e957d6de94d0d0.webm?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/96a6470e52fa354571e957d6de94d0d0.mp4?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect Shoot\u2019em Up bullet-hell roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities: every encounter with star system inhabitants and every gifted Core Enhancer can completely shift the course of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep campaign mode with multiple difficulty levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/d397177066bc8e59cab0c54eb2d1b916.poster.avif?t=1768973492\" aria-label=\"One pilot. One galaxy. Infinite upgrades\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/d397177066bc8e59cab0c54eb2d1b916.webm?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/d397177066bc8e59cab0c54eb2d1b916.mp4?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your winning strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble an arsenal of powerful Core Enhancers\u2014offensive, defensive, or utility modules. Mix them freely to trigger insane effects, pushing the value of your victories into the stratosphere with killer synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/8d40059038bc617d3d649d31256f6e05.poster.avif?t=1768973492\" aria-label=\"Every fight is chaos. Every Core is power.\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/8d40059038bc617d3d649d31256f6e05.webm?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/8d40059038bc617d3d649d31256f6e05.mp4?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the unique, pulse-pounding world of Holy Justice. A soundtrack of synthwave and cyberpunk rock will fuel your energy and keep you in the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Core Enhancers, discover alien races across the galaxy, and uncover secrets with every campaign. Use the Captain\u2019s Codex to track your best combos, favorite devices, and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788820?t=1768973492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788820?t=1768973492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/969fc7f26a999361d6a40c41861e5cf53a9aae98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768973492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/969fc7f26a999361d6a40c41861e5cf53a9aae98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768973492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4053870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Justice</strong> is a cosmic bullet-hell roguelike inspired by classic Shoot\u2019em Ups and expanded with a unique upgrade system powered by Core Enhancers. Their synergies let you shred space pirates and bosses into stardust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge surprising super-combos with unique Core Enhancers to unlock wild effects and interactions. Earn space credits to grab epic and legendary devices, and discover secret synergies as you progress. Any advantage might be the key to liberating star systems and defeating the ultimate boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/96a6470e52fa354571e957d6de94d0d0.poster.avif?t=1768973492\" aria-label=\"Unlock devastating Enhancer Cores in an epic space roguelike!\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/96a6470e52fa354571e957d6de94d0d0.webm?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/96a6470e52fa354571e957d6de94d0d0.mp4?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect Shoot\u2019em Up bullet-hell roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities: every encounter with star system inhabitants and every gifted Core Enhancer can completely shift the course of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep campaign mode with multiple difficulty levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/d397177066bc8e59cab0c54eb2d1b916.poster.avif?t=1768973492\" aria-label=\"One pilot. One galaxy. Infinite upgrades\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/d397177066bc8e59cab0c54eb2d1b916.webm?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/d397177066bc8e59cab0c54eb2d1b916.mp4?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your winning strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble an arsenal of powerful Core Enhancers\u2014offensive, defensive, or utility modules. Mix them freely to trigger insane effects, pushing the value of your victories into the stratosphere with killer synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/8d40059038bc617d3d649d31256f6e05.poster.avif?t=1768973492\" aria-label=\"Every fight is chaos. Every Core is power.\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/8d40059038bc617d3d649d31256f6e05.webm?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/extras/8d40059038bc617d3d649d31256f6e05.mp4?t=1768973492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the unique, pulse-pounding world of Holy Justice. A soundtrack of synthwave and cyberpunk rock will fuel your energy and keep you in the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Core Enhancers, discover alien races across the galaxy, and uncover secrets with every campaign. Use the Captain\u2019s Codex to track your best combos, favorite devices, and more!</p>","developers":["BigButton Co. Sp.z o.o."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788820/3643c50feef3d439fba1aac264daee775a053213/header.jpg?t=1768973492","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.8+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3788820/1532686623/ab4355d609095744a98b2ca4a00eaea2d2d68ac3/1760